#BlueLink5 I/O Channels: Ports` ` , vs_dyn Ports` , vs_kin Ports`

#BlueLink6 I/O Channels: Ports` ` , vs_dyn Ports` , vs_dyn Ports`

#MiscYellow1
! Include Parallel Models datasets for vehicle hauling
*CPAR_INCLUDE Batch\MultiVehicles\MVeh_4da9db6e-8605-4c24-8b5d-5b655cf39ed4.par
*CPAR_INCLUDE Batch\MultiVehicles\MVeh_288cdeea-175e-4d34-bd7a-bc7e560e25dd.par
#ENDMYellow

LIVE_SERVER_UPDATE_FREQ_MAX 60

#EMBEDDED_NOTES
#Models: Simulink dataset for use with the Parallel Solvers example: Vehicle Hauling.
#
# -When using the Parallel Solvers library for this example the Models: Simulink dataset attached to each vehicle must:
#  a) use the same Simulink model file,
#  b) use identical settings for the working directory (which should also contain the Simulink .mdl or .slx file), and
#  c) adhere to the following Import/Export configuration guidelines:
#     - The Lead vehicle exports the restraint positions and velocities
#     - The Lead vehicle imports the restrained vehicle reation forces
#     - The hauled vehicle exports restraint reaction forces and vertical tire forces
#END_EMBEDDED_NOTES

